{"title":"레오","artist":"유우리","sourceId":"reference:n82yjChnkUQh5EfvHVIN","sourceHash":"5e37150c55fdd8f4fbf7841bb71114bc529ccab24eb7db888aa703d0ff245f10","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","referenceProvider":"LRCLIB","referenceId":11389059,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":14.42,"end":16.86,"text":"ショーケースの中過ごしていた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":16.86,"end":19.2,"text":"誰もかれもが過ぎ去っていた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":19.2,"end":21.99,"text":"怖かったんだ あの日君に","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":21.99,"end":24.65,"text":"連れられるまでは","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":24.65,"end":27.28,"text":"僕と同じの小さな手","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":27.28,"end":30.19,"text":"転げまわり くすぐりあう僕ら","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":30.19,"end":35.05,"text":"こんなに君の事好きになってた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":35.05,"end":41.64,"text":"どんなときでも傍に居て","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":41.64,"end":47.64,"text":"君が言うなら ああ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":47.64,"end":52.54,"text":"名前はレオ 名前呼んでよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":52.54,"end":57.64,"text":"君がつけてくれた名前だから","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":57.64,"end":62.78,"text":"嬉しい時も悲しい時も","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":62.78,"end":69.2,"text":"傍に居ると決めた大事な人","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":78.94,"end":81.31,"text":"君が大きくなるほどに","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":81.31,"end":83.87,"text":"僕との時間は減るが道理","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":83.87,"end":86.22,"text":"遠くに君の友達同士","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":86.22,"end":89.02,"text":"仕方がないよなぁ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":89.02,"end":91.74,"text":"最近つけるその香水","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":91.74,"end":94.75999999999999,"text":"鼻の利く僕にとっては辛いや","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":94.75999999999999,"end":99.57,"text":"今日も帰りは遅くなるんだろうか","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":99.57,"end":106.28999999999999,"text":"君が居ない部屋 夢を見る","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":106.28999999999999,"end":112.08,"text":"あの日のこと また","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":112.08,"end":116.82,"text":"名前はレオ 名前呼んでよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":116.82,"end":122.02,"text":"君がつけてくれた名前だから","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":122.02,"end":127.18,"text":"寂しいけれど 悲しいけれど","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":127.18,"end":133.53,"text":"傍に居ると決めた大事な人","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":143.78,"end":148.91,"text":"君が誰かと暮らすことを","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":148.91,"end":153.9,"text":"伝えに帰ってきた夜に","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":153.9,"end":158.46,"text":"撫でてくれたね きっとお別れだね","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":158.46,"end":165.48,"text":"最後にさ 会えたから ねぇ幸せだよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":176.53,"end":181.46,"text":"名前はレオ 名前呼んでよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":181.46,"end":186.62,"text":"君がつけてくれた名前だから","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":186.62,"end":191.85,"text":"もう泣かないでよ 名前呼んでよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":191.85,"end":197.35,"text":"あの日より大きな手で撫でてくれた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":197.35,"end":202.18,"text":"名前はレオ 名前呼んでよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":202.18,"end":207.27,"text":"君がくれた名前で良かったよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":207.27,"end":212.46,"text":"忘れないでよ それでいいんだよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":212.46,"end":217.93,"text":"新しい誰かにまた名前つけて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}